Spec: Explicit owner STUN endpoint snapshot

Purpose:
  Bound and normalize public discovery destinations before an Agent starts its transport child.

Owns:
  ./StunEndpoints.java

Must:
  Accept an empty disabled list or at most four unique canonical numeric IPv4 endpoints with nonzero ports, without DNS or socket operations.
  Reject fake-IP, multicast, unspecified, broadcast, link-local, malformed or duplicate destinations and return an immutable defensive snapshot.
  Serialize only the configured list into the private child environment, with no implicit endpoints.
